          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൊതുകുവല (kotukuvala) is a native Dravidian compound of കൊതുക്, a mosquito (DEDR 2086), and വല, a net (DEDR 5288)."
            }
          ]
        },
