          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശുചിത്വം (śucitvaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit śucitva, \"clearness, purity\" (Monier-Williams), from śuci, clean, with the abstract ending -tva."
